{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"有效满射"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"有效满射"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 具有"},{"Local":{"url":"拉回","text":"拉回"}},{"Plain":"以及"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现(单纯图表的余极限)","text":"单纯余极限"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>对于 $\\mathcal C$ 中的态射 $f\\colon Y\\to X$, 若 "},{"Local":{"url":"Čech脉","text":"Čech 脉"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{\\v{C}}(f)=(\\cdots Y\\times_X Y\\rightrightarrows Y)\r\n$$\n的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现(单纯图表的余极限)","text":"几何实现"}},{"Plain":"为 $X$, 则称 $f$ 为<strong>有效满射</strong>.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>意象中的满射</h3>\n<p>在 "},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"$\\infty$-意象"}},{"Plain":"中有效满射的概念等同于"},{"Local":{"url":"满射(范畴论)","text":"满射"}},{"Plain":". 见"},{"Local":{"url":"意象中的满射","text":"意象中的满射"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}